menu "Amity factory reset button"
    config AMITY_FW_RESET_BUTTON
        bool "Enable the FW_RESET button"
        default y
        help
            Enable the active-low GPIO4 button on the Amity board. Hold it for
            ten seconds to restore factory settings and restart. A release is
            required after boot before a press can trigger a reset.

            On current devices without the button, the internal pull-up keeps
            the unused input inactive. Disable if GPIO4 is used by other hardware.
endmenu
